This aiu-context defines the installation spine: the single answer to "how far
has this knowledge object progressed from ignorance to original
contribution?" Ten states, numbered 0–9. Every state is a single
uppercase token so it doubles as the AIU's first org tag.

The spine is deliberately narrow. It does not measure teaching skill,
creativity, research independence, judgment, or impact — those are
capability dimensions for a later phase, not rungs. It does not include
workflow states either: SUSPENDED / ARCHIVED / DORMANT live in the
separate STATUS aiu-context, because you can suspend a beginner subject
or an expert one. Stage and status are orthogonal by design.

How an AIU moves along the spine is governed by gates, not scores.
Birth sets AWARE (creating the AIU proves the domain entered your
awareness). The first successful review promotes AWARE → ACQUIRING
automatically. Everything above ACQUIRING advances only through
explicit attestation with recorded evidence — the review machinery
measures memory performance, and memory performance alone never proves
understanding, transfer, or originality. Higher gates must be claimed,
never inferred.

